OL,3,GNEWSAFlash flooding at lido blamed on
OL,4,Aclimate change
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 90-year-old lido has been forced to
OL,7,Fclose following flash flooding as a
OL,8,Fresult of climate change, according to
OL,9,FAnglian Water.
OL,11,FIt is the second time in just over a
OL,12,Fyear that the lido at Norton Common,
OL,13,FLetchworth in Hertfordshire has closed
OL,14,Fdue to flooding.
OL,16,FSeason ticket holder Kate Hughes, 44,
OL,17,Fcontacted BBC Your Voice to say the
OL,18,Fpool had closed due to flooding and
OL,19,F"sewage discharge".
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
