OL,3,GNEWSAFlash flooding at lido blamed on
OL,4,Aclimate change
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnglian Water said that a storm
OL,7,Foverflow operated "following
OL,8,Fexceptionally high rainfall in a short
OL,9,Famount of time between 24-30 August,"
OL,10,Fand added climate change means rain is
OL,11,Flikely to be heavier and will "simply
OL,12,Frun off" dry ground.
